{"availability":"available","full":"Deepak92939339/trace","name":"trace","description":"Trace — B2B quotation system: approvals, signed buyer acceptance, sealed PDFs and an email outbox. Next.js + Supabase, 1,000+ database tests.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-03T03:53:10Z","updated":"2026-10-09T18:37:05Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tender-eta-orpin.vercel.app","topics":["b2b","nextjs","postgresql","quotation","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://tender-eta-orpin.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:38:03.385Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T06:38:03.385Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T06:38:03.385Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:33.565Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:38:03.385Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Priced once. Approved on the record. Issued unchanged.","A B2B quotation is not a document. It is a commercial commitment: a price, a discount someone was allowed to give, terms someone approved, and a buyer who said yes to exactly that version.","Most quoting tools treat it like a spreadsheet with a PDF button. Numbers drift between screen and printout, approvals live in chat threads, and when a customer says \"we never agreed to that\", nobody can prove what was sent."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deepak92939339/trace/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"158c810fa8f16ddf5e9007705c120cf9e6e7e402bc5a2e749030f9371a4afde5","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:33.663Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:33.663Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Priced once. Approved on the record. Issued unchanged.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deepak92939339/trace/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"158c810fa8f16ddf5e9007705c120cf9e6e7e402bc5a2e749030f9371a4afde5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deepak9293933